Smallest repair / scope: One defect per PR: implement state-checked wait/retry and wake on space/data at each fd family, preserving O_NONBLOCK and partial-transfer semantics. Cell-local Unix-socket repair can be lean (4–6 h); entire issue requires all four repairs. No listed Tier file is inherently required.

Verification / oracle: New deterministic backpressure/data-arrival tests for all four sites; blocking operation remains asleep until progress, returns partial count correctly, O_NONBLOCK still EAGAIN, signal interruption/peer-close correct. Existing `unix_socket_test`, `pipe_test`, `fifo_test`, `devfs_test` are regression supplements, not proof of these untested arms.

Known implementation estimate: 16 h.

